    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51573" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰῶτα</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], τό</span>, indecl., (Hebr.
